WEBVTT

00:03:58.413 --> 00:04:01.288
So, the next time you see a headline
about a new miracle cure

00:04:01.329 --> 00:04:03.496
or the danger posed 
by an everyday substance,

00:04:03.538 --> 00:04:05.538
try to learn more about the original study

00:04:05.579 --> 00:04:09.163
and the limitations inherent in any
epidemiological study or clinical trial

00:04:09.204 --> 00:04:11.204
before jumping to conclusions.